<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>알뜰이 식단표 + 어남선생 레시피</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" as="style" crossorigin href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v2/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f2f0eb;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --text: #1e1e1e;
      --text-secondary: #6b6b6b;
      --accent: #e74c3c;
      --accent-light: #fde8e5;
      --border: #e8e5df;
      --tag-bg: #f7f6f2;
      --recipe-tag: #fff3e0;
      --recipe-tag-text: #e65100;
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0; padding: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      font-family: 'Pretendard Variable', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }
    #root {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 48px 24px 80px;
    }

    /* Header */
    header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    header h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
    header .subtitle { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
    header .subtitle strong { color: var(--text); }
    .badge-row {
      display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
      background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .badge.warn { background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); }
    .badge.success { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }
    .badge.recipe { background: var(--recipe-tag); color: var(--recipe-tag-text); }

    /* Summary Cards */
    .summary-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    .summary-card {
      background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .summary-card .label {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .summary-card .value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .summary-card .value.accent { color: var(--accent); }
    .summary-card .sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 2px; }

    /* Strategy Box */
    .strategy-box {
      background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 14px;
    }
    .strategy-box strong { color: var(--accent); }

    /* Section */
    .section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .section-title .emoji { font-size: 20px; }

    /* Table */
    .table-wrap {
      background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;
    }
    thead th {
      background: #faf9f6; text-align: left; padding: 14px 16px;
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text-secondary);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    tbody td {
      padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0ede8;
      vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.5;
    }
    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    tbody tr:hover { background: #faf9f6; }
    .day-label { font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
    .day-label .date { font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 12px; margin-left: 2px; }
    .recipe-badge {
      display: inline-block; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; background: var(--recipe-tag);
      color: var(--recipe-tag-text); margin-left: 4px; white-space: nowrap;
      cursor: help;
    }
    .week-label td {
      background: #f7f6f2; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-secondary); letter-spacing: 0.02em; padding: 8px 16px;
    }
    .chip-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
    .chip {
      display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; background: var(--tag-bg); color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .budget-table td:last-child,
    .budget-table th:last-child { text-align: right; }
    .budget-table td:first-child { font-weight: 500; }

    /* Recipe Cards */
    .recipe-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(420px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .recipe-card {
      background: var(--card); border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .recipe-card-header {
      padding: 16px 20px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .recipe-card-header .r-title {
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .recipe-card-header .r-meta {
      font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 4px;
      display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .recipe-card-header .r-meta a {
      color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;
    }
    .recipe-card-header .r-meta a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .recipe-card-body {
      padding: 14px 20px 18px;
    }
    .recipe-card-body .r-subtitle {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .recipe-card-body .r-ingredients {
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .recipe-card-body .r-steps {
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7;
      padding-left: 18px; color: var(--text);
    }
    .recipe-card-body .r-steps li {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .recipe-card-body .r-steps li::marker { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
    .recipe-card-body .r-tip {
      margin-top: 10px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px;
      background: #fff8e1; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;
      border-left: 3px solid #ffc107;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center; padding-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8;
    }
    footer strong { color: var(--text); }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      #root { padding: 24px 16px 60px; }
      header h1 { font-size: 22px; }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      table { font-size: 13px; }
      thead th, tbody td { padding: 10px 12px; }
      .recipe-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="root">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <h1>🍱 <span>알뜰이</span> 식단표</h1>
    <p class="subtitle"><strong>7/13(월) 오늘 ~ 7/19(일) 다음주</strong> · 4인 가족 · 하루 <strong>두끼</strong> (조식+석식)</p>
    <div class="badge-row">
