            <td class="day-label">화<span class="date"> 7/7</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🥞 <strong>감자전+계란국🥚</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">감자·양파·파·계란·식용유</span></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">수<span class="date"> 7/8</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🥩 <strong>패티스테이크+감자볶음+밥🍚</strong></td>
