          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">금<span class="date"> 7/10</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🐔 <strong>애들 치킨(할인 15k)🍗</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">치킨</span></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">토<span class="date"> 7/11</span></td>
