            <td>🥓 <strong>베이컨파스타🧈</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">베이컨·파스타면·마늘·마요</span></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">화<span class="date"> 7/14</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🍔 <strong>버거+감자튀김</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">패티·상추·감자·마요</span></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">수<span class="date"> 7/15</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🥘 <strong>된장찌개+밥🍚</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">된장·양파·파·마늘</span></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">목<span class="date"> 7/16</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🥓 <strong>베이컨계란볶음밥🍳</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">베이컨·계란·밥·마요</span></div></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="day-label">금<span class="date"> 7/17</span></td>
            <td>간단 아침</td>
            <td>🦐 <strong>버터새우+감자볶음</strong></td>
            <td><div class="chip-list"><span class="chip">새우·감자·버터·양파</span></div></td>
